e doing is  really important and is having a lot of  impact on people and is really valuable  the more likely they're gonna want to  stay and like their job and be more  accountable  also try to tie them into the bigger  picture of what their task is instead of  just saying do this this is your job get  it done the next thing and the last  thing I want to quickly talk about is  try to share your wins so a lot of the  people in your company again may not  have a lot of connection to the  customers they may not see how the work  that you're doing is actually being  useful and helpful and if they do a lot  of times it may just be complaint rights  of some of the people who are working  for me they'll be working with some of  our authors and and all they'll get as a  problem emails right most people don't  write in to say hey this is great  they're writing to say I'm having a  problem with this or can you help me  with that and so the in your employees  day-to-day lives all they're seen is a  negative and the problems and that's  what they're trying to solve and they  may not see all the great stuff that  you're doing so for my part of the  business I'll always get emails from  people saying hey thanks for that video  or thanks to a newsletter it was really  inspiring I really appreciate it now I'm  not more motivated than ever to want to  keep core of my business and that's  great that gives me a boost and I want  to keep doing the stuff that I'm doing  because of those comments and what I'll  do is I'll share that with my team so  that they see that hey you know we're  really having an impact here it's not  just the problems that we're getting  there's a lot of benefit that we're  doing is a lot of good that we're doing  and we're helping a lot of people so  more you can tie people into that and  share those wins the more likely they're  going to again like their jobs care more  about the business and be more  accountable as well so I hope that helps  you guys like the video please give it a  thumbs up and I'd also love to hear an  awesome feedback if you want to leave a  comment below the video and stay tuned  for the next episode  you
 

